coda-fortran
============

This work is a modern Fortran translation of computational algorithms from
coda 0.19-4.1, "Output Analysis and Diagnostics for MCMC".

Original coda authors and contributors are listed in original/AUTHORS and
original/DESCRIPTION. The original package is licensed GPL (>= 2). This
translation is GPL-2.0-or-later.

Plotting, interactive menus, and R-specific I/O/object infrastructure were
not translated.
